#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deutsch's algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritma Deutsch"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-"
"algorithms/quantum-query-algorithms/deutsch-algorithm.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-"
"algorithms/quantum-query-algorithms/deutsch-algorithm.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deutsch's algorithm solves the parity problem for the special case that $n = 1.$\n"
"In the context of quantum computing this problem is sometimes referred to as *Deutsch's problem*, and we'll follow that nomenclature in this lesson.\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma Deutsch memecahkan masalah paritas untuk kasus khusus bahwa $n = 1.$\n"
"Dalam konteks komputasi kuantum masalah ini kadang-kadang disebut sebagai *masalah Deutsch*, dan kita akan mengikuti nomenklatur tersebut dalam pelajaran ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To be precise, the input is represented by a function $f:\\Sigma \\rightarrow \\Sigma$ from one bit to one bit.\n"
"There are four such functions:\n"
msgstr ""
"Lebih tepatnya, inputnya diwakili oleh fungsi $f:\\Sigma \\rightarrow \\Sigma$ dari satu bit ke satu bit.\n"
"Ada empat fungsi seperti itu:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\rule[-10mm]{0mm}{10mm}\n"
"\\begin{array}{c|c}\n"
"  a & f_1(a)\\\\\n"
"  \\hline\n"
"  0 & 0\\\\\n"
"  1 & 0\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\begin{array}{c|c}\n"
"  a & f_2(a)\\\\\n"
"  \\hline\n"
"  0 & 0\\\\\n"
"  1 & 1\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\begin{array}{c|c}\n"
"  a & f_3(a)\\\\\n"
"  \\hline\n"
"  0 & 1\\\\\n"
"  1 & 0\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\begin{array}{c|c}\n"
"  a & f_4(a)\\\\\n"
"  \\hline\n"
"  0 & 1\\\\\n"
"  1 & 1\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\rule[-10mm]{0mm}{10mm}\n"
"\\begin{array}{c|c}\n"
"  a & f_1(a)\\\\\n"
"  \\hline\n"
"  0 & 0\\\\\n"
"  1 & 0\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\begin{array}{c|c}\n"
"  a & f_2(a)\\\\\n"
"  \\hline\n"
"  0 & 0\\\\\n"
"  1 & 1\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\begin{array}{c|c}\n"
"  a & f_3(a)\\\\\n"
"  \\hline\n"
"  0 & 1\\\\\n"
"  1 & 0\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\begin{array}{c|c}\n"
"  a & f_4(a)\\\\\n"
"  \\hline\n"
"  0 & 1\\\\\n"
"  1 & 1\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The first and last of these functions are *constant* and the middle two are *balanced*, meaning that the two possible output values for the function occur the same number of times as we range over the inputs.\n"
"Deutsch's problem is to determine which of these two categories the input function belongs to: constant or balanced.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fungsi pertama dan terakhir bersifat *konstan* dan dua yang di tengah bersifat *seimbang*, artinya dua nilai keluaran yang mungkin untuk fungsi tersebut terjadi dengan jumlah yang sama saat kita merentang masukan.\n"
"Masalah Deutsch adalah menentukan kategori mana yang dimiliki fungsi input: konstan atau seimbang.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Figure title=\"Deutsch's problem\">\n"
"Input:  a function $f:\\{0,1\\}\\rightarrow\\{0,1\\}$ \\\n"
"Output: $0$ if $f$ is constant, $1$ if $f$ is balanced\n"
"</Figure>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Figure title=\"Masalah Deutsch\">\n"
"Input: fungsi $f:\\{0,1\\}\\rightarrow\\{0,1\\}$ \\\n"
"Output: $0$ jika $f$ konstan, $1$ jika $f$ seimbang\n"
"</Figure>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If we view the input function $f$ in Deutsch's problem as representing "
"random access to a string, we're thinking about a two-bit string: "
"$f(0)f(1).$\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika kita melihat fungsi input $f$ dalam masalah Deutsch sebagai mewakili "
"akses acak ke sebuah string, kita sedang memikirkan string dua-bit: "
"$f(0)f(1).$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{array}{cc}\n"
"\\mathsf{function} & \\mathsf{string}\\\\\n"
"\\hline\n"
"f_1 & 00 \\\\\n"
"f_2 & 01 \\\\\n"
"f_3 & 10 \\\\\n"
"f_4 & 11\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{array}{cc}\n"
"\\mathsf{function} & \\mathsf{string}\\\\\n"
"\\hline\n"
"f_1 & 00 \\\\\n"
"f_2 & 01 \\\\\n"
"f_3 & 10 \\\\\n"
"f_4 & 11\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When viewed in this way, Deutsch's problem is to compute the parity (or, "
"equivalently, the exclusive-OR) of the two bits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dilihat dari cara ini, masalah Deutsch adalah menghitung paritas (atau, "
"setara, XOR eksklusif) dari dua bit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Every classical query algorithm that correctly solves this problem must query both bits: $f(0)$ and $f(1).$\n"
"If we learn that $f(1) = 1,$ for instance, the answer could still be $0$ or $1,$ depending on whether $f(0) = 1$ or $f(0) = 0,$ respectively.\n"
"Every other case is similar; knowing just one of two bits doesn't provide any information at all about their parity.\n"
"So, the Boolean circuit described in the previous section is the best we can do in terms of the number of queries required to solve this problem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap algoritma kueri klasik yang memecahkan masalah ini dengan benar harus mengkueri kedua bit: $f(0)$ dan $f(1).$\n"
"Jika kita mengetahui bahwa $f(1) = 1,$ misalnya, jawabannya masih bisa $0$ atau $1,$ tergantung apakah $f(0) = 1$ atau $f(0) = 0,$ masing-masing.\n"
"Setiap kasus lainnya serupa; mengetahui hanya satu dari dua bit tidak memberikan informasi apapun tentang paritasnya.\n"
"Jadi, sirkuit Boolean yang dijelaskan di bagian sebelumnya adalah yang terbaik yang bisa kita lakukan dalam hal jumlah kueri yang diperlukan untuk memecahkan masalah ini.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum circuit description {#quantum-circuit-description}"
msgstr "Deskripsi sirkuit kuantum {#quantum-circuit-description}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deutsch's algorithm solves Deutsch's problem using a single query, therefore providing a quantifiable advantage of quantum over classical computations.\n"
"This may be a modest advantage — one query as opposed to two — but we have to start somewhere.\n"
"Scientific advances sometimes have seemingly humble origins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma Deutsch memecahkan masalah Deutsch menggunakan satu kueri, sehingga memberikan keunggulan yang dapat diukur dari kuantum atas komputasi klasik.\n"
"Ini mungkin merupakan keunggulan yang sederhana — satu kueri dibanding dua — tetapi kita harus mulai dari suatu tempat.\n"
"Kemajuan ilmiah kadang-kadang memiliki asal-usul yang tampaknya sederhana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Here is a quantum circuit that describes Deutsch's algorithm:\n"
msgstr ""
"Berikut adalah sirkuit kuantum yang mendeskripsikan algoritma Deutsch:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Deutsch's algorithm](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-"
"algorithms/quantum-query-algorithms/Deutsch-circuit.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Algoritma Deutsch](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-"
"algorithms/quantum-query-algorithms/Deutsch-circuit.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Analysis {#analysis}"
msgstr "Analisis {#analysis}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To analyze Deutsch's algorithm, we will trace through the action of the "
"circuit above and identify the states of the qubits at the times suggested "
"by this figure:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menganalisis algoritma Deutsch, kita akan menelusuri aksi sirkuit di "
"atas dan mengidentifikasi keadaan qubit pada waktu yang disarankan oleh "
"gambar ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![States during Deutsch's algorithm](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-"
"of-quantum-algorithms/quantum-query-algorithms/Deutsch-circuit-states.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Keadaan selama algoritma Deutsch](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-"
"of-quantum-algorithms/quantum-query-algorithms/Deutsch-circuit-states.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The initial state is $\\vert 1\\rangle \\vert 0 \\rangle,$ and the two "
"Hadamard operations on the left-hand side of the circuit transform this "
"state to\n"
msgstr ""
"Keadaan awalnya adalah $\\vert 1\\rangle \\vert 0 \\rangle,$ dan dua operasi"
" Hadamard di sisi kiri sirkuit mengubah keadaan ini menjadi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\pi_1 \\rangle = \\vert - \\rangle \\vert + \\rangle\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle - \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle - \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\pi_1 \\rangle = \\vert - \\rangle \\vert + \\rangle\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle - \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 0\\rangle\n"
"+ \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle - \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(As always, we're following Qiskit's qubit ordering convention, which puts "
"the top qubit to the right and the bottom qubit to the left.) It may feel "
"unintuitive to write this product state partly distributed (leaving the "
"states of qubit 1 factored out), but this will make our later expressions "
"more compact.\n"
msgstr ""
"(Seperti biasa, kita mengikuti konvensi urutan qubit Qiskit, yang "
"menempatkan qubit atas di sebelah kanan dan qubit bawah di sebelah kiri.) "
"Mungkin terasa tidak intuitif untuk menulis keadaan produk ini sebagian "
"didistribusikan (membiarkan keadaan qubit 1 difaktorkan keluar), tetapi ini "
"akan membuat ekspresi kita selanjutnya lebih ringkas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, the $U_f$ gate is performed.\n"
"According to the definition of the $U_f$ gate, the value of the function $f$ for the classical state of the top/rightmost qubit is XORed onto the bottom/leftmost qubit, which transforms $\\vert \\pi_1\\rangle$ into the state\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, gate $U_f$ dilakukan.\n"
"Sesuai definisi gate $U_f$, nilai fungsi $f$ untuk keadaan klasik qubit atas/paling kanan di-XOR ke qubit bawah/paling kiri, yang mengubah $\\vert \\pi_1\\rangle$ menjadi keadaan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\pi_2 \\rangle\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl( \\vert 0 \\oplus f(0) \\rangle - \\vert 1 \\oplus f(0) \\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 0 \\rangle\n"
"+ \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl( \\vert 0 \\oplus f(1) \\rangle - \\vert 1 \\oplus f(1) \\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 1 \\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\pi_2 \\rangle\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl( \\vert 0 \\oplus f(0) \\rangle - \\vert 1 \\oplus f(0) \\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 0 \\rangle\n"
"+ \\frac{1}{2} \\bigl( \\vert 0 \\oplus f(1) \\rangle - \\vert 1 \\oplus f(1) \\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 1 \\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We can simplify this expression by observing that the formula\n"
msgstr "Kita bisa menyederhanakan ekspresi ini dengan mengamati bahwa rumus\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert 0 \\oplus a\\rangle - \\vert 1 \\oplus a\\rangle = (-1)^a \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle - \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert 0 \\oplus a\\rangle - \\vert 1 \\oplus a\\rangle = (-1)^a \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle - \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"works for both possible values $a\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
"More explicitly, the two cases are as follows.\n"
msgstr ""
"berlaku untuk kedua nilai yang mungkin $a\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
"Lebih eksplisit, dua kasusnya adalah sebagai berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert 0 \\oplus 0\\rangle - \\vert 1 \\oplus 0\\rangle\n"
"& = \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\vert 1 \\rangle\n"
"= (-1)^0 \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle - \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr)\\\\\n"
"\\vert 0 \\oplus 1\\rangle - \\vert 1 \\oplus 1\\rangle & = \\vert 1 \\rangle - \\vert 0\\rangle\n"
"= (-1)^1 \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle - \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert 0 \\oplus 0\\rangle - \\vert 1 \\oplus 0\\rangle\n"
"& = \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\vert 1 \\rangle\n"
"= (-1)^0 \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle - \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr)\\\\\n"
"\\vert 0 \\oplus 1\\rangle - \\vert 1 \\oplus 1\\rangle & = \\vert 1 \\rangle - \\vert 0\\rangle\n"
"= (-1)^1 \\bigl( \\vert 0\\rangle - \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, we can alternatively express $\\vert\\pi_2\\rangle$ like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan demikian, kita bisa mengekspresikan $\\vert\\pi_2\\rangle$ secara "
"alternatif seperti ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert\\pi_2\\rangle\n"
"  & = \\frac{1}{2} (-1)^{f(0)} \\bigl( \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\vert 1 \\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{1}{2} (-1)^{f(1)} \\bigl( \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\vert 1 \\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\vert - \\rangle \\biggl( \\frac{(-1)^{f(0)} \\vert 0\\rangle + (-1)^{f(1)} \\vert 1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\\biggr).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert\\pi_2\\rangle\n"
"  & = \\frac{1}{2} (-1)^{f(0)} \\bigl( \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\vert 1 \\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 0 \\rangle\n"
"  + \\frac{1}{2} (-1)^{f(1)} \\bigl( \\vert 0 \\rangle - \\vert 1 \\rangle \\bigr) \\vert 1 \\rangle \\\\\n"
"  & = \\vert - \\rangle \\biggl( \\frac{(-1)^{f(0)} \\vert 0\\rangle + (-1)^{f(1)} \\vert 1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\\biggr).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Something interesting just happened!\n"
"Although the action of the $U_f$ gate on standard basis states leaves the top/rightmost qubit alone and XORs the function value onto the bottom/leftmost qubit, here we see that the state of the top/rightmost qubit has changed (in general) while the state of the bottom/leftmost qubit remains the same — specifically being in the $\\vert - \\rangle$ state before and after the $U_f$ gate is performed.\n"
"This phenomenon is known as the *phase kickback*, and we will have more to say about it shortly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sesuatu yang menarik baru saja terjadi!\n"
"Meskipun aksi gate $U_f$ pada keadaan basis standar membiarkan qubit atas/paling kanan sendirian dan meng-XOR nilai fungsi ke qubit bawah/paling kiri, di sini kita melihat bahwa keadaan qubit atas/paling kanan telah berubah (secara umum) sementara keadaan qubit bawah/paling kiri tetap sama — secara khusus berada dalam keadaan $\\vert - \\rangle$ sebelum dan sesudah gate $U_f$ dilakukan.\n"
"Fenomena ini dikenal sebagai *phase kickback*, dan kita akan membahasnya lebih lanjut segera.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With one final simplification, which is to pull the factor of $(-1)^{f(0)}$ "
"outside of the sum, we obtain this expression of the state "
"$\\vert\\pi_2\\rangle$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan satu penyederhanaan akhir, yaitu menarik faktor $(-1)^{f(0)}$ ke luar"
" dari jumlahan, kita mendapatkan ekspresi keadaan $\\vert\\pi_2\\rangle$ "
"ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert\\pi_2\\rangle\n"
"  & = (-1)^{f(0)} \\vert - \\rangle\n"
"      \\biggl( \\frac{\\vert 0\\rangle + (-1)^{f(0) \\oplus f(1)} \\vert 1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"  & = \\begin{cases}\n"
"        (-1)^{f(0)} \\vert - \\rangle \\vert + \\rangle & \\text{if $f(0) \\oplus f(1) = 0$}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"        (-1)^{f(0)} \\vert - \\rangle \\vert - \\rangle & \\text{if $f(0) \\oplus f(1) = 1$}.\n"
"      \\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert\\pi_2\\rangle\n"
"  & = (-1)^{f(0)} \\vert - \\rangle\n"
"      \\biggl( \\frac{\\vert 0\\rangle + (-1)^{f(0) \\oplus f(1)} \\vert 1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\\biggr) \\\\\n"
"  & = \\begin{cases}\n"
"        (-1)^{f(0)} \\vert - \\rangle \\vert + \\rangle & \\text{if $f(0) \\oplus f(1) = 0$}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"        (-1)^{f(0)} \\vert - \\rangle \\vert - \\rangle & \\text{if $f(0) \\oplus f(1) = 1$}.\n"
"      \\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Notice that in this expression, we have $f(0) \\oplus f(1)$ in the exponent of $-1$ as opposed to $f(1) - f(0),$ which is what we might expect from a purely algebraic viewpoint, but we obtain the same result either way.\n"
"This is because the value $(-1)^k$ for any integer $k$ depends only on whether $k$ is even or odd.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa dalam ekspresi ini, kita memiliki $f(0) \\oplus f(1)$ di eksponen $-1$ bukan $f(1) - f(0),$ yang mungkin kita harapkan dari sudut pandang aljabar murni, tetapi kita mendapatkan hasil yang sama dengan cara manapun.\n"
"Ini karena nilai $(-1)^k$ untuk bilangan bulat $k$ manapun hanya bergantung pada apakah $k$ genap atau ganjil.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Applying the final Hadamard gate to the top qubit leaves us with the state\n"
msgstr ""
"Menerapkan gate Hadamard akhir ke qubit atas meninggalkan kita dengan "
"keadaan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\pi_3 \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"  (-1)^{f(0)} \\vert - \\rangle \\vert 0 \\rangle & \\text{if $f(0) \\oplus f(1) = 0$}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"  (-1)^{f(0)} \\vert - \\rangle \\vert 1 \\rangle & \\text{if $f(0) \\oplus f(1) = 1$},\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\pi_3 \\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"  (-1)^{f(0)} \\vert - \\rangle \\vert 0 \\rangle & \\text{if $f(0) \\oplus f(1) = 0$}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"  (-1)^{f(0)} \\vert - \\rangle \\vert 1 \\rangle & \\text{if $f(0) \\oplus f(1) = 1$},\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"which leads to the correct outcome with probability $1$ when the "
"right/topmost qubit is measured.\n"
msgstr ""
"yang mengarah ke hasil yang benar dengan probabilitas $1$ ketika qubit "
"kanan/paling atas diukur.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Further remarks on the phase kickback {#further-remarks-on-the-phase-"
"kickback}"
msgstr ""
"Catatan lebih lanjut tentang phase kickback {#further-remarks-on-the-phase-"
"kickback}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before moving on, let's look at the analysis above from a slightly different"
" angle that may shed some light on the phase kickback phenomenon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum melanjutkan, mari kita lihat analisis di atas dari sudut yang "
"sedikit berbeda yang mungkin memberikan pencerahan tentang fenomena phase "
"kickback.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, notice that the following formula works for all choices of bits "
"$b,c\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, perhatikan bahwa rumus berikut berlaku untuk semua pilihan bit "
"$b,c\\in\\Sigma.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert b \\oplus c\\rangle = X^c \\vert b \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert b \\oplus c\\rangle = X^c \\vert b \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This can be verified by checking it for the two possible values $c = 0$ and "
"$c = 1$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini bisa diverifikasi dengan memeriksa untuk dua nilai yang mungkin $c = 0$ "
"dan $c = 1$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert b \\oplus 0 \\rangle & = \\vert b\\rangle = \\mathbb{I} \\vert b \\rangle = X^0 \\vert b \\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert b \\oplus 1 \\rangle & = \\vert \\neg b\\rangle = X \\vert b \\rangle = X^1 \\vert b \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert b \\oplus 0 \\rangle & = \\vert b\\rangle = \\mathbb{I} \\vert b \\rangle = X^0 \\vert b \\rangle\\\\\n"
"\\vert b \\oplus 1 \\rangle & = \\vert \\neg b\\rangle = X \\vert b \\rangle = X^1 \\vert b \\rangle.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using this formula, we see that\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan rumus ini, kita melihat bahwa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U_f \\bigl(\\vert b\\rangle \\vert a \\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= \\vert b \\oplus f(a) \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"= \\bigl(X^{f(a)}\\vert b \\rangle\\bigr) \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U_f \\bigl(\\vert b\\rangle \\vert a \\rangle\\bigr)\n"
"= \\vert b \\oplus f(a) \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"= \\bigl(X^{f(a)}\\vert b \\rangle\\bigr) \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for every choice of bits $a,b\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
"Because this formula is true for $b=0$ and $b=1,$ we see by linearity that\n"
msgstr ""
"untuk setiap pilihan bit $a,b\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
"Karena rumus ini benar untuk $b=0$ dan $b=1,$ kita lihat dengan linearitas bahwa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U_f \\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle \\bigr) = \\bigl(X^{f(a)}\\vert \\psi \\rangle\\bigr) \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U_f \\bigl( \\vert \\psi \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle \\bigr) = \\bigl(X^{f(a)}\\vert \\psi \\rangle\\bigr) \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for all qubit state vectors $\\vert \\psi\\rangle,$ and therefore\n"
msgstr ""
"untuk semua vektor keadaan qubit $\\vert \\psi\\rangle,$ dan oleh karena "
"itu\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U_f \\bigl( \\vert - \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle \\bigr) = \\bigl(X^{f(a)} \\vert - \\rangle \\bigr) \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"= (-1)^{f(a)} \\vert - \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U_f \\bigl( \\vert - \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle \\bigr) = \\bigl(X^{f(a)} \\vert - \\rangle \\bigr) \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"= (-1)^{f(a)} \\vert - \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The key that makes this work is that $X\\vert - \\rangle = - \\vert - \\rangle.$\n"
"In mathematical terms, the vector $\\vert - \\rangle$ is an *eigenvector* of the matrix $X$ having *eigenvalue* $-1.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Kunci yang membuat ini bekerja adalah bahwa $X\\vert - \\rangle = - \\vert - \\rangle.$\n"
"Dalam istilah matematis, vektor $\\vert - \\rangle$ adalah *eigenvector* dari matriks $X$ yang memiliki *eigenvalue* $-1.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We'll discuss eigenvectors and eigenvalues in greater detail in the upcoming"
" lesson on *Phase estimation and factoring,* where the phase kickback "
"phenomenon is generalized to other unitary operations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan membahas eigenvector dan eigenvalue secara lebih rinci dalam "
"pelajaran mendatang tentang *Estimasi fase dan faktorisasi,* di mana "
"fenomena phase kickback digeneralisasikan ke operasi uniter lainnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Keeping in mind that scalars float freely through tensor products, we find "
"an alternative way of reasoning how the operation $U_f$ transforms $\\vert "
"\\pi_1\\rangle$ into $\\vert \\pi_2\\rangle$ in the analysis above:\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengingat bahwa skalar mengalir bebas melalui produk tensor, kita menemukan "
"cara alternatif untuk menalar bagaimana operasi $U_f$ mengubah $\\vert "
"\\pi_1\\rangle$ menjadi $\\vert \\pi_2\\rangle$ dalam analisis di atas:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert \\pi_2 \\rangle\n"
"  & = U_f \\bigl( \\vert - \\rangle \\vert + \\rangle \\bigr)\\\\\n"
"  & = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} U_f \\bigl(\\vert - \\rangle \\vert 0\\rangle \\bigr)\n"
"    + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} U_f \\bigl(\\vert - \\rangle \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr)\\\\\n"
"  & = \\vert - \\rangle \\biggl( \\frac{(-1)^{f(0)} \\vert 0\\rangle + (-1)^{f(1)} \\vert 1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\\biggr).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"  \\vert \\pi_2 \\rangle\n"
"  & = U_f \\bigl( \\vert - \\rangle \\vert + \\rangle \\bigr)\\\\\n"
"  & = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} U_f \\bigl(\\vert - \\rangle \\vert 0\\rangle \\bigr)\n"
"    + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} U_f \\bigl(\\vert - \\rangle \\vert 1\\rangle \\bigr)\\\\\n"
"  & = \\vert - \\rangle \\biggl( \\frac{(-1)^{f(0)} \\vert 0\\rangle + (-1)^{f(1)} \\vert 1\\rangle}{\\sqrt{2}}\\biggr).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Implementation in Qiskit {#implementation-in-qiskit}"
msgstr "Implementasi dalam Qiskit {#implementation-in-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's see how we can implement Deutsch's algorithm in Qiskit. We'll start with a version check and then perform the imports required solely for this implementation.\n"
"For the implementations of other algorithms that follows, we'll perform the required imports separately for the sake of greater modularity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang mari kita lihat bagaimana kita bisa mengimplementasikan algoritma Deutsch dalam Qiskit. Kita akan mulai dengan pemeriksaan versi kemudian melakukan impor yang diperlukan khusus untuk implementasi ini.\n"
"Untuk implementasi algoritma lain yang mengikuti, kita akan melakukan impor yang diperlukan secara terpisah demi modularitas yang lebih besar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First we'll define a quantum circuit that implements a query gate for one of the four functions $f_1,$ $f_2,$ $f_3,$ or $f_4$ from one bit to one bit described previously. As we already mentioned, the implementation of query gates is not really a part of Deutsch's algorithm itself;\n"
"here we're essentially just showing one way to prepare the input, in the form of a circuit implementation of a query gate.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama kita akan mendefinisikan sirkuit kuantum yang mengimplementasikan gate kueri untuk salah satu dari empat fungsi $f_1,$ $f_2,$ $f_3,$ atau $f_4$ dari satu bit ke satu bit yang dijelaskan sebelumnya. Seperti yang sudah disebutkan, implementasi gate kueri sebenarnya bukan bagian dari algoritma Deutsch itu sendiri;\n"
"di sini kita pada dasarnya hanya menunjukkan satu cara untuk mempersiapkan input, dalam bentuk implementasi sirkuit dari gate kueri.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can see what each circuit looks like using the `draw` method. Here's the "
"circuit for the function $f_3.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita bisa melihat seperti apa setiap sirkuit menggunakan metode `draw`. "
"Berikut adalah sirkuit untuk fungsi $f_3.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-"
"of-quantum-algorithms/quantum-query-algorithms/deutsch-algorithm/extracted-"
"outputs/787e3c81-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-"
"of-quantum-algorithms/quantum-query-algorithms/deutsch-algorithm/extracted-"
"outputs/787e3c81-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next we will create the actual quantum circuit for Deutsch's algorithm, substituting the query gate with a quantum circuit implementation given as an argument. Shortly we'll plug in one of the four circuits defined by the function `deutsch_function` we defined earlier.\n"
"Barriers are included to show the visual separation between the query gate implementation and the rest of the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya kita akan membuat sirkuit kuantum aktual untuk algoritma Deutsch, menggantikan gate kueri dengan implementasi sirkuit kuantum yang diberikan sebagai argumen. Sebentar lagi kita akan memasukkan salah satu dari empat sirkuit yang didefinisikan oleh fungsi `deutsch_function` yang kita definisikan sebelumnya.\n"
"Barrier disertakan untuk menunjukkan pemisahan visual antara implementasi gate kueri dan sisa sirkuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Again we can see what the circuit looks like using the `draw` method.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekali lagi kita bisa melihat seperti apa sirkuit menggunakan metode "
"`draw`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-"
"of-quantum-algorithms/quantum-query-algorithms/deutsch-algorithm/extracted-"
"outputs/27b41067-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/fundamentals-"
"of-quantum-algorithms/quantum-query-algorithms/deutsch-algorithm/extracted-"
"outputs/27b41067-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, we'll create a function that runs the circuit previously defined "
"one time and outputs the appropriate result: \"constant\" or \"balanced.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhirnya, kita akan membuat fungsi yang menjalankan sirkuit yang sebelumnya "
"didefinisikan satu kali dan mengeluarkan hasil yang sesuai: \"constant\" "
"atau \"balanced.\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can now run Deutsch's algorithm on any one of the four functions defined "
"above.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang bisa menjalankan algoritma Deutsch pada salah satu dari empat "
"fungsi yang didefinisikan di atas.\n"
